    "text": "The Stable Small Cancellation Conjecture: If F is a free group of rank r ⩾ 2,\nthen, for any fixed n > 0, there exists a generic subset S of F n such that, for any\nautomorphism ϕ of F , the set ϕ(S) satisfies the small cancellation condition C ′ (1/6).\n                                                                             P. E. Schupp",
